    "description": "Commercial agreement terms on Partner so renewal and notice deadlines don't get missed.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* Agreement Signed — Date\n\n* Renewal Date — Date\n\n* Notice Period — Text, free form (Joyce, Slack Aug 14 14:32)\n\n* Auto-Renew — Checkbox\n\n* Exclusivity — Text, free form\n\n* Agreement File — Salesforce Files\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Do NOT create 'Introduced By'. Removed Aug 13 — Joyce: 'introduced by, I would take this out, this is weird.'\n\n* Standalone section, independent of Billing.\n\n* File stored in Salesforce, not Drive/GCP.\n\n* Do not mark any field required on the page layout. No validation rules are being built yet — decided 2026-08-17.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* Outstanding. Mirror of BUILD-128.\n\n* Provenance: PT-4.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Taryn doc PT-4\n\n* Aug 13 call\n\n* Slack Joyce Aug 14 14:32\n\nDependencies: BUILD-136\n\nOwner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nCreated 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
